          'Brand photography',
          'Full video production',
          'Dedicated creative team',
          '20% off, billed annually',
        ],
      },
      {
        num: '04',
        badge: 'Full command',
        title: 'Command',
        forLine: 'For brands where marketing is mission-critical.',
        desc: "Overdrive, amplified: active website management, reputation and risk cover, and a dedicated account manager who answers like it's their own brand on the line. 360° covered.",
